### GET all books
GET http://localhost:4000/books

### GET book by id
GET http://localhost:4000/books/1

### POST add book
POST http://localhost:4000/books
Content-Type: application/json

{ "id": 4, "title": "Clean Code", "author": "Robert C. Martin", "price": 550, "category": "Programming" }

### PUT update book
PUT http://localhost:4000/books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "The Alchemist (Updated)", "price": 399 }

### DELETE book
DELETE http://localhost:4000/books/1
